status GREEN -- four reds closed on metal, all four mine, plus one duplicate withdrawn after the rebase: harness_roster (50 pen legs), standing_equipment (the run card re-read), vocabulary_collection (one card word), instrument_refusal (my own hedged probe). stash_record witness green with 105 pen legs and faults=0; the 28 new legs proven to bite by running the same control against the elder scan, where 19 refuse; cold roster pass guard_red on two guards, both closed on metal: harness_roster GREEN with 49 pen legs, standing_equipment GREEN after the run card re-read
recommend keep-going -- the work drawer reads zero for the first time since it was drawn, so the next lap opens on a box whose one actionable number is honest; the two carried questions stay Keaton's (a gate word for a ledger-parked red, and whether |- 0 should parse)
